[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 429 - The stolen lord pumps your elves
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Llanowar Elves and have Threaten in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls an untapped Elvish Archdruid (other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-lord-follows-controller | "You control" in a static ability means its current controller (CR 109.5, 613.1b before 613.4c): Threaten the Archdruid and it now pumps your Llanowar Elves to 2/2, so both attack for 4 with no blocker left; without Threaten the Elves are 1/1 and the Archdruid can block
